sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant V as VeriTrust
  participant DB as Registry/DB
  participant HF as HF-managed deployment
  C->>V: Submit artifact + idempotency key
  V->>V: Validate, normalize, hash
  V->>DB: Resolve and persist exact deployment
  DB-->>V: resolution_id + deployment_id + revision
  V->>HF: Contract request + request_id
  HF-->>V: Response + provider/deployment identity
  V->>V: Validate schema, labels, hashes, receipt identity
  alt valid and matching
    V->>DB: Persist receipt and evidence
    V->>V: Sufficiency, correlation, policy
    V-->>C: Decision or accepted/poll
  else invalid or mismatched
    V->>DB: Persist failed attempt/reason
    V-->>C: Degraded/uncertain/failed by policy
  end

